{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative Care for Whole You</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Gentle, evidence-informed holistic medicine. Personalized plans that prioritize education, prevention, and sustainable vitality.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="site-root">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#7bd389"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#5aa0ff"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="44" fill="url(#g1)"/><text x="50" y="57" font-size="28" font-family="sans-serif" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</text></svg>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" id="main-nav">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="index.html">Welcome</a></li>
          <li><a href="services.html">Offerings</a></li>
          <li><a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">Our Way</a></li>
          <li><a href="pricing.html">Invest</a></li>
          <li><a href="about.html">Meet</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <button id="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="nav-toggle">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Intensive, Whole-Person Care — Rooted in Science, Guided by You</h1>
          <p class="lead">At {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, we blend modern diagnostics, gentle therapies, and lifestyle rituals to help you feel steadier, clearer, and more energized. We don’t promise miracles — we promise partnership, clarity, and practical tools.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="about.html">Meet {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="meta-list">
            <li>Virtual & in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <div class="card mosaic">
            <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 400 300" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><linearGradient id="pgrad" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#f8f1ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#eef8ff"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#pgrad)"/></svg>
            <div class="stats">
              <h3>Ritual + Evidence</h3>
              <p class="small">Personalized plans, optional labs, guided follow-ups.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ritual" class="ritual">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Foundational Rituals — Simple steps, compounding benefit</h2>
        <p class="intro">The little habits that support big change. We scaffold a daily rhythm combining movement, restorative sleep, targeted nutrition, and stress practices tailored to your life.</p>
        <div class="ritual-grid">
          <div class="ritual-card"><h4>Morning Reset</h4><p>Gentle movement, brief breathwork, and an intake checklist to track symptoms and priorities.</p></div>
          <div class="ritual-card"><h4>Midday Check-In</h4><p>Micro-habits and food choices that stabilize energy and digestion without overwhelm.</p></div>
          <div class="ritual-card"><h4>Evening Wind-Down</h4><p>Strategies for sleep hygiene, mental boundary-setting, and preparing for restorative sleep.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what-to-expect" class="expect">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What to expect in an intensive plan</h2>
        <p class="intro">We design an evidence-informed roadmap. Your journey may include in-depth intake, optional labs for extra clarity, a personalized plan, and frequent follow-ups during the intensive period.</p>
        <div class="expect-grid">
          <div class="step"><strong>1. Intake</strong><p>A comprehensive conversation about your history, priorities, and context.</p></div>
          <div class="step"><strong>2. Data & Options</strong><p>Optional labs and diagnostics are presented as educational tools — not as a single answer.</p></div>
          <div class="step"><strong>3. Personalized Plan</strong><p>Targeted interventions: nutrition, supplements (if appropriate), mind-body practices, and referrals.</p></div>
          <div class="step"><strong>4. Follow-ups</strong><p>Structured check-ins to refine the plan and teach you practical skills for self-management.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="schedule" class="schedule">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Scheduling & Flow</h2>
        <p class="intro">An intensive typically runs across a concentrated window with regular touchpoints so we can iterate quickly and keep momentum.</p>
        <ul class="schedule-list">
          <li><strong>Initial visit</strong> — 75 minutes (intake & baseline)</li>
          <li><strong>Plan visit</strong> — 45 minutes (review labs, set interventions)</li>
          <li><strong>Weekly check-ins</strong> — 20-30 minutes (adjust and teach)</li>
          <li><strong>Wrap & maintenance</strong> — 30-45 minutes (transition plan)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Investment — Intensive Program Options</h2>
        <p class="intro">Transparent pricing for focused work. Payment plans available; we can discuss affordability during your first call.</p>
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Starter Intensive</h3>
            <p class="rate">$650</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Initial 75-minute intake</li>
              <li>1 follow-up (45 min)</li>
              <li>Email support for 2 weeks</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn" href="book.html">Choose Starter</a>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card featured">
            <h3>Deep Intensive</h3>
            <p class="rate">$1,900</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Initial 75-minute intake</li>
              <li>3 follow-ups (30 min each)</li>
              <li>Optional lab coordination (costs extra)</li>
              <li>Email + brief messages for 8 weeks</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn primary" href="book.html">Start the Deep Plan</a>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Maintenance Package</h3>
            <p class="rate">$420 / month</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Monthly check-ins</li>
              <li>Plan refinement</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn" href="contact.html">Inquire</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="disclaimer">We focus on education and supportive care. Individual results vary. Plans do not guarantee cures and are tailored to your context.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Frequently asked (short and sweet)</h2>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>Do you take insurance?</summary>
            <div class="answer">We are currently out-of-network for most insurers. We provide superbills you can submit to your carrier when applicable.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Will I need labs?</summary>
            <div class="answer">Optional labs can help clarify complex cases. We review the benefits and costs together and only proceed with informed consent.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What makes this "intensive"?</summary>
            <div class="answer">An intensive has frequent touchpoints and a structured timeline to build and refine habits quickly. It’s best for people ready to lean in for change.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta">
      <div class="container cta-inner">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready to begin a focused journey?</h2>
          <p>Book a discovery call with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. We’ll discuss fit, expectations, and next steps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn primary big" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Questions? Contact us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>Integrative & holistic medicine · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="services.html">Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="contacts">
        <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>
        <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All rights reserved.</div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>"} 
